>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `get_flag`

``` hol4
HOLFlags.get_flag : flag -> int
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Read an integer-valued flag.

A call to `get_flag f` returns the current value of `f` in the ambient
context. `get_flagC` reads it from a context the caller supplies
instead.

### Failure

Fails if `f` does not name a trace.

